  "statement_html": "<p>\tDéterminer graphiquement, à l'aide de l'appliquette GeoGebra, le nombre dérivé de la fonction <span class=\"larger\">\\(f{\\left(x \\right)} = slib_{s} = \\operatorname{sign}{\\left(4 \\right)} = v e c t o r \\left( 3 + 1, \\  i, \\  2 \\cdot 10 r a n d o m - 10\\right) = slib_{s} \\left(4 r a n d o m + 1\\right)\\) </span> en utilisant les points suivants de la courbe représentant \\(f\\) :\t<span class=\"larger\"> \\(A_{1}\\) </span> d'abscisse <span class=\"larger\"> \\(-3\\)</span> ; <span class=\"larger\">\\(A_{2}\\) </span>d'abscisse <span class=\"larger\">\\(-1,5\\)</span> et <span class=\"larger\">\\(A_{3}\\) </span>d'abscisse <span class=\"larger\">\\(0\\)</span>\t</p>\t\t<div class=\"wims_instruction\">\t<strong>Utilisation de l'appliquette GeoGebra :</strong>\t<ul>\t  <li><span class=\"wims_emph\">Entrer la fonction correcte dans la zone de saisie. Saisir : \\(f{\\left(x \\right)} =\\)slib_s=sign(4); slib_V=vector(3+1,i,random(2*10)-10); slib_V[1]=slib_s*(random(abs(4))+1);print(Pol(slib_V,x)) </span>, puis cliquer hors de la zone de saisie pour valider.</li>\t  <li>L'abscisse du point \\(A\\) est réglée par le curseur.</li>\t  <li>La tangente à la courbe représentant \\(f\\) au point \\(A\\) est tracée automatiquement.</li>\t</ul>\t</div>\t  <div class=\"pax-geogebra\" id=\"ggbApplet0\" data-geogebra=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;ggbApplet0&quot;, &quot;params&quot;: {&quot;id&quot;: &quot;ggbApplet0&quot;, &quot;width&quot;: &quot;912&quot;, &quot;height&quot;: &quot;498&quot;, &quot;language&quot;: &quot;fr&quot;, &quot;enableLabelDrags&quot;: &quot;false&quot;, &quot;enableShiftDragZoom&quot;: &quot;true&quot;, &quot;enableRightClick&quot;: &quot;true&quot;, &quot;showToolBar&quot;: &quot;true&quot;, &quot;showMenuBar&quot;: &quot;false&quot;, &quot;showResetIcon&quot;: &quot;false&quot;, &quot;showToolBarHelp&quot;: &quot;false&quot;, &quot;showAlgebraInput&quot;: &quot;true&quot;, &quot;customToolBar&quot;: &quot;0 | 40&quot;, &quot;errorDialogsActive&quot;: &quot;false&quot;, &quot;useBrowserForJS&quot;: &quot;true&quot;, &quot;enable3d&quot;: &quot;false&quot;, &quot;showAlgebraWindow&quot;: &quot;false&quot;, &quot;showFullscreenButton&quot;: &quot;false&quot;, &quot;filename&quot;: &quot;/api/static/H5/analysis/oefderivLP.fr/images/nbder2.ggb&quot;}, &quot;is3d&quot;: false, &quot;commands&quot;: &quot;&quot;}\"></div>\t\t<ul class=\"spacer\">\t  <li><span class = \"bold\">Au point \\(A_{1}\\) d'abscisse \\(-3\\)</span>, la tangente à la courbe correspond à une fonction affine  <span class=\"oef-menu\" name=\"reply4\" data-label=\"\"></span> ;\t  <br>\\(f'(-3) =\\)  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"4\"></span> .</li>\t   <li><span class = \"bold\">Au point \\(A_{2}\\) d'abscisse \\(-1,5\\)</span>, la tangente à la courbe correspond à une fonction affine  <span class=\"oef-menu\" name=\"reply5\" data-label=\"\"></span> ;\t  <br>\\(f'(-1.5) =\\)  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"4\"></span> .</li>\t  <li><span class = \"bold\">Au point \\(A_{3}\\) d'abscisse \\(0\\)</span>, la tangente à la courbe correspond à une fonction affine  <span class=\"oef-menu\" name=\"reply6\" data-label=\"\"></span> ;\t  <br>\\(f'(0) =\\)  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3\" data-size=\"4\"></span> .</li>\t</ul>\t",
